Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:55:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 113/113] PC5: a mode-sized window shows where it is (Wine patch 0973)

Heroes of Might and Magic IV in 2D only drew its picture from the desktop's top
left at the mode's scaled size, while frames showed the centred part a display
mode covers: its left side was cut off and the right was black.
